  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Indonesia - Strategic Sector Cooperation on Environment - Phase I</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">1.Implementation of Indonesian policies on waste management strengthened through:
- Capacity building of Indonesian authorities
- Best practices for waste separation and recycling identified, adjusted and tested
- Lessons learned from best practices included in revised regulation
2. Approaches to separation and treatment of organic waste analyzed, adapted and implemented in selected areas
3. Systems for collection and analysis of data on waste streams presented and recommendations and training provided for Indonesian system for monitoring of waste and recycling streams.</narrative>
  </description>
