  <result type="1">
   <title>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">Output 2.1: Joint workshops, training and studies have been conducted by the partners and capacity built in KLHK, at national and local level as well as in other relevant stakeholders, to de-cide and built adequate treatment facilities for organic waste in selected locations and be able to integrate this in the ac-tion plans to reach the Jakstranas goals.</narrative>
   </title>
   <reference code="276613" vocabulary="99"></reference>
