     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Project proposals by cities</narrative>
    </title>
    <period>
     <period-start iso-date="2020-01-01"></period-start>
     <period-end iso-date="2020-12-31"></period-end>
     <target value="On-line workshops, trainings"></target>
     <actual value="2 study tours to Denmark have included sessions and visits to institutions and facilities handling organic waste. 
Workshops and trainings have been conducted in Indonesia on organic waste management organ-ised by DEPA and Odense Waste Utility. Visits to Denmark have also included private companies running organic waste facilities. DEPA has also visited cities and discussed on-going activities and options for new projects on organic waste."></actual>
    </period>
